"CommonEvents.rxdata/143/@name"	"TUTORIAL #1"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/144/@list/1/code101/p0"	"ONE-SHOT CREEPS"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/144/@list/2/code401/p0"	"Creeps can be killed easily in one punch."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/144/@list/3/code101/p0"	"The party gets as many EXP Pts "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/144/@list/4/code401/p0"	"as the level of your HERO, and the "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/144/@list/5/code401/p0"	"latter gets 2 extra EXP pts."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/144/@list/7/code401/p0"	"If an NRG Card is equipped, "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/144/@list/8/code401/p0"	"its holder also gains 2 NRG pts."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/144/@name"	"TUTORIAL #2 (STREET)"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/145/@list/13/code101/p0"	"High Love means a bit of healing"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/145/@list/14/code401/p0"	"every turn for the girl."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/145/@list/15/code401/p0"	"They also come back with more Life"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/145/@list/16/code401/p0"	"after they've been knocked-out."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/145/@name"	"TUTORIAL #3"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/9/code401/p0"	"Once the battle is over, any dead"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/10/code401/p0"	"character will also be back."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/12/code101/p0"	"Find out more about this system?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/13/code102/p0/1"	"Yes"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/13/code102/p0/2"	"No"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/17/code402/p1"	"Yes"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/19/code401/p0"	"Characters return with LOVE/10 Life pts "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/20/code401/p0"	"plus 3 pts per Mandragora found."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/21/code101/p0"	"ﾂｷ HERO: 5 turns"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/22/code401/p0"	"ﾂｷ LAURA: 2 turns"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/23/code401/p0"	"ﾂｷ SANDY: 2 turns"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/24/code401/p0"	"ﾂｷ CINDY: 3 turns"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/25/code101/p0"	"ﾂｷ \\i[294]: 4 turns"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/26/code401/p0"	"ﾂｷ \\i[295]: 4 turns"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/27/code401/p0"	"ﾂｷ \\i[296]: 1 turn"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/29/code401/p0"	"ﾂｷ \\i[297]: 4 turns"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@list/30/code401/p0"	"ﾂｷ \\i[298]: 3 turns"
