"CommonEvents.rxdata/146/@name"	"TUTORIAL #1b"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/1/code101/p0"	"INTERACTING WITH A GIRL:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/2/code401/p0"	"Interacting with the same girl "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/3/code401/p0"	"several times in a row will result in "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/4/code401/p0"	"her getting fed up."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/5/code101/p0"	"Keep an eye on her reaction,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/6/code401/p0"	"a  \\i[16] or  \\i[19]\\i[19]\\i[19] means that "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/7/code401/p0"	"maybe you should stop, and interact"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/8/code401/p0"	"with another one instead."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/9/code101/p0"	"Each time you complete a location,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/10/code401/p0"	"all girls become more ""available"" again"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/11/code401/p0"	"for social interactions."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/13/code401/p0"	"Every 6 fight and every boss battle"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/14/code401/p0"	"they also get a bit more available."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/16/code101/p0"	"Find out more?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/17/code102/p0/1"	"Yes"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/17/code102/p0/2"	"No"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/21/code402/p1"	"Yes"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/23/code401/p0"	"If a girl is HIGH,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/24/code401/p0"	"she'll be more easily teased."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/26/code401/p0"	"Sandy gets a bigger boost than"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/27/code401/p0"	"the other girls when she's high."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/29/code401/p0"	"If a girl is DRUNK,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/30/code401/p0"	"she'll be more easily seduced."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/31/code101/p0"	"Laura gets a bigger boost than the other "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/32/code401/p0"	"girls when she's drunk. The interaction skill "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/33/code401/p0"	"involving her also decreases more from the"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/34/code401/p0"	"""gifting"" of hearts, brains and fingers."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/36/code401/p0"	"Be careful, if everybody is drunk,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/37/code401/p0"	"it might become difficult to survive."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/38/code101/p0"	"\\i[297] can receive double "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/39/code401/p0"	"more seducing and teasing."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/40/code401/p0"	"\\i[296] can receive quadruple "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/41/code401/p0"	"more teasing."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@list/43/code402/p1"	"No"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/147/@name"	"TUTO"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/1/code101/p0"	"GUN SYMBOLS:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/2/code401/p0"	"It's important to know when a friend is"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/3/code401/p0"	"carrying a gun so you don't waste bullets."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/5/code401/p0"	"During a fight, you'll find the following"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/6/code401/p0"	"symbols next to the name of a gun holder."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/7/code101/p0"	"ﾂ､ : gun and diverse smaller "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/8/code401/p0"	"guns than shotguns"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/9/code401/p0"	"ﾂ､ﾂ､ : big gun (shotguns)"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/10/code401/p0"	"ﾂ､ﾂ､ﾂ､ : rifle (kalachnikovs)"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/11/code101/p0"	"Use a skill (or defend) when "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/12/code401/p0"	"you don't want to waste a bullet."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/13/code401/p0"	"It's not possible to follow the HERO "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/14/code401/p0"	"on his skill when having a gun equipped,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/16/code101/p0"	"except for Karine,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/17/code401/p0"	"because she is so naturally submissive,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/18/code401/p0"	"and Cindy, because she's kinda lost now"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/19/code401/p0"	"(and also naturally very submissive)."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/21/code401/p0"	"Consequently, if a girl is inflicted with the"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/22/code401/p0"	"""submissive"" state, she'll follow too."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/25/code101/p0"	"except for Karine,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/26/code401/p0"	"because she is so naturally submissive."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/27/code401/p0"	"Consequently, if a girl is inflicted with the"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/28/code401/p0"	"""submissive"" state, she'll follow too."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/31/code101/p0"	"When running out of bullets,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/32/code401/p0"	"the best weapon in the inventory"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@list/33/code401/p0"	"is automatically equipped."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/148/@name"	"TUTO GUNS"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/149/@name"	"TUTO EXP"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/149/@list/2/code101/p0"	"COOL HIDDEN EXP BONUSES TO KNOW:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/149/@list/3/code401/p0"	"\\n[1] gets +50 EXP per battle for each"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/149/@list/4/code401/p0"	"naked girl in the party."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/149/@list/5/code101/p0"	"He also receives POWER and ATTACK"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/149/@list/6/code401/p0"	"boosts. The more naked girls, the stronger"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/149/@list/7/code401/p0"	"the boosts."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/149/@list/9/code401/p0"	"Isa gets +80 EXP per battle if Karine is also "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/149/@list/10/code401/p0"	"in the party and another +50 EXP if naked."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/151/@list/1/code101/p0"	"DEFENDING SKILLS:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/151/@list/2/code401/p0"	"SPEED is the key attribute to defending"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/151/@list/3/code401/p0"	"skills, unlike normal attacks where it's"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/151/@list/4/code401/p0"	"POWER that matters."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/151/@name"	"T1"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/1/code101/p0"	"HIGH:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/2/code401/p0"	"Being inflicted with the ""High"" status can "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/3/code401/p0"	"give extras to some characters. First of all,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/4/code401/p0"	"you can only attack enemies normally."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/5/code101/p0"	"Influence on base stats:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/6/code401/p0"	"Power Pts 120% Obedience Pts 120%"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/7/code401/p0"	"Speed Pts 60% Love Pts 110%"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/8/code401/p0"	"Stamina Pts 80%"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/11/code401/p0"	"Cindy gets her LEVEL multiplied "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/12/code401/p0"	"by 2 as extra EXP when she's high."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/15/code101/p0"	"\\n[1] and  \\i[295] get their LEVEL "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/16/code401/p0"	"as extra EXP each turn when high."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/17/code401/p0"	"The others get their LEVEL divided "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/18/code401/p0"	"by 2 instead."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/20/code401/p0"	"\\i[296] gets LEVELx4 in EXP Pts "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@list/21/code401/p0"	"if she is High after a fight. "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/152/@name"	"T2"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/1/code101/p0"	"DRUNK:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/2/code401/p0"	"Being inflicted with the ""Drunk"" status can "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/3/code401/p0"	"give extras to some characters."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/4/code101/p0"	"First of all,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/5/code401/p0"	"special skills become unusable."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/6/code401/p0"	"This includes the HERO's interactive"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/7/code401/p0"	"skills with the girls."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/8/code101/p0"	"Influence on base stats:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/9/code401/p0"	"Love Pts 130%"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/10/code401/p0"	"Speed Pts 80% "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/11/code401/p0"	"Attack Pts 80%"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/12/code101/p0"	"This status ailment has 35% chances "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/13/code401/p0"	"of going if the character is hit."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/14/code401/p0"	"After 6 turns, it has 25% chances of "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/15/code401/p0"	"going each turn."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/16/code101/p0"	"Because Drunk increases the LOVE "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/17/code401/p0"	"stat, it automatically makes social inter-"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/18/code401/p0"	"action between HERO and drunk girls "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@list/19/code401/p0"	"more successful."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/153/@name"	"T3"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/154/@list/1/code101/p0"	"EXTRA  ACTIONS & GUNS:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/154/@list/2/code401/p0"	"Except when specified otherwise, "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/154/@list/3/code401/p0"	"characters holding guns cannot perform"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/154/@list/4/code401/p0"	"multi-hits and follow a skill from \\n[1]."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/154/@list/5/code101/p0"	"Karine is an exception to this, as she "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/154/@list/6/code401/p0"	"may follow up on a skill from \\n[1]."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/154/@list/7/code401/p0"	"Give her a gun with caution."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/154/@name"	"T4"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/1/code101/p0"	"ALCHEMY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/2/code401/p0"	"Whether you and a girl are meant to"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/3/code401/p0"	"be together depends on a variety of factors."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/4/code101/p0"	"LOVE and OBEDIENCE points obviously"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/5/code401/p0"	"matter, but so does your overall reputation"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/6/code401/p0"	"among all the girls, as well as how each one"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/7/code401/p0"	"of them fared during the adventure."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/9/code101/p0"	"Find out more about the formula?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/10/code102/p0/1"	"Yes"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/10/code102/p0/2"	"No"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/14/code402/p1"	"Yes"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/15/code101/p0"	"LOV * OBD + Womanizer Score"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/16/code401/p0"	"+ #fights + #activity * 20 + #cards score"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/17/code401/p0"	"- #defeats * 5 - #party defeats * 20"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/18/code101/p0"	"If you have a decent score with her,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/19/code401/p0"	"you'll be able to become her boyfriend."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/20/code401/p0"	"To get more from her, you need to develop"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/21/code401/p0"	"her LOVE and OBEDIENCE points."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/22/code101/p0"	"Pay attention that it will be the value"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/23/code401/p0"	"without equipment and without state"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/24/code401/p0"	"(eg drunk, high etc) that will be taken "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/25/code401/p0"	"into account."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/26/code101/p0"	"You need a value superior to 800 in either"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/27/code401/p0"	"LOVE or OBEDIENCE (or both) to obtain"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/28/code401/p0"	"more privileges from a girl."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/30/code101/p0"	"Playing in FRANTIC mode, you get a 100 pts"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/31/code401/p0"	"bonus for LOVE and OBEDIENCE calculations,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/32/code401/p0"	"as well as the overall MATCH formula."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@list/37/code402/p1"	"No"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/155/@name"	"T5"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/156/@list/1/code101/p0"	"RESERVE PARTY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/156/@list/2/code401/p0"	"A non-fighting character doesn't get "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/156/@list/3/code401/p0"	"EXP but heals 40 Life pts and 10 NRG "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/156/@list/4/code401/p0"	"points each fight."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/156/@list/6/code401/p0"	"Girls who ARE fighting automatically"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/156/@list/7/code401/p0"	"get healed of LOVE/50 Life pts each turn."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/156/@name"	"T6"
