"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/3/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/4/code401/p0"	"\\n[1], do you need to remind us"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/5/code401/p0"	"all the time how men and women"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/6/code401/p0"	"are getting ripped apart?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/12/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/13/code401/p0"	"I don't want to man up!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/14/code401/p0"	"I'm a sexy woman who intends to"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/15/code401/p0"	"become a teacher, not some"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/17/code401/p0"	"Tomb Raider heroine!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/24/code401/p0"	"Or Tifa. Even better if you're Tifa."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/29/code401/p0"	"Don't be such a nerd!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/31/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/32/code401/p0"	"I like nerds, they can be cool!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/34/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/35/code401/p0"	"(\\n[1],"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/36/code401/p0"	"a bad boy on the outside,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@list/37/code401/p0"	"yet sometimes so nerdy!)"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/234/@name"	"MCD FINGER"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/11/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/12/code401/p0"	"I don't eat burgers, have"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/13/code401/p0"	"you have a look at my waist?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/15/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/16/code401/p0"	"No, I look at something else,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/17/code401/p0"	"are you sure they aren't full of soda?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/19/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/20/code401/p0"	"Ahaha you mean my boobs?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/21/code401/p0"	"They're 100% natural and I've always"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/22/code401/p0"	"been like this, slender with big boobs!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/24/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/25/code401/p0"	"So am I, and I don't brag "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@list/26/code401/p0"	"constantly about it. Let's go!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/235/@name"	"MCD BRAIN"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/236/@list/10/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/236/@list/11/code401/p0"	"But it's a big one!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/236/@list/12/code401/p0"	"Must have been a romantic guy!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/236/@list/14/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/236/@list/15/code401/p0"	"You're not funny!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/236/@list/16/code401/p0"	"Focus on the monsters, big guy,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/236/@list/17/code401/p0"	"show your big heart indeed!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/236/@name"	"MCD HEART"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/237/@list/61/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/237/@list/62/code401/p0"	"You don't know something as"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/237/@list/63/code401/p0"	"simple as that?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/237/@list/65/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/237/@list/66/code401/p0"	"What? Fuck off!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/237/@list/93/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/237/@list/94/code401/p0"	"Isa, calm the fuck down, and "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/237/@list/95/code401/p0"	"tell me where the warehouse is."
