"CommonEvents.rxdata/265/@name"	"Chopper"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/267/@name"	"BEING HIGH (every turn)"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/268/@list/2/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/268/@list/3/code401/p0"	"Yeah baby, "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/268/@list/4/code401/p0"	"more of these little cuties!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/268/@list/12/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/268/@list/13/code401/p0"	"Don't tell me you're the clichﾃｩ American"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/268/@list/14/code401/p0"	"surfer who loves opiates and-"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/268/@name"	"Hallu"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/269/@list/9/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/269/@list/10/code401/p0"	"We've made it this far,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/269/@list/11/code401/p0"	"that's no coincidence."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/269/@name"	"COMMENT"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/270/@list/34/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/270/@list/35/code401/p0"	"Yep, I got a role offer for that, but..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/270/@list/36/code401/p0"	"I turned it down."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/270/@list/58/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/270/@list/59/code401/p0"	"Food is more important, Laura."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/270/@list/60/code401/p0"	"We'll all get hungry and dehydrated if"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/270/@list/61/code401/p0"	"we don't eat and drink."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/270/@name"	"C TALK"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/271/@name"	"ISA ACTIV"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/272/@name"	"KARINE"
