"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/27/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/28/code401/p0"	"... You really like that ""woman"", "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/29/code401/p0"	"\\n[1]?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/40/code401/p0"	"Karine, lower your bikini top."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/48/code401/p0"	"He'll see your minuscule boobs"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/49/code401/p0"	"and judge for himself."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/51/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/52/code401/p0"	"I'm the most well-endowed here,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/53/code401/p0"	"and I don't think it matters much,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/54/code401/p0"	"especially right now."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/56/code401/p0"	"Can't we just postpone this?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/82/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/83/code401/p0"	"Even you can do better than this."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/84/code401/p0"	"C'mon, press up that little flatties of you,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/85/code401/p0"	"let 'em ridiculous nips get out!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/107/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/108/code401/p0"	"Finally! Of course you'll lose it,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/109/code401/p0"	"there's nothing to hold it in the "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/110/code401/p0"	"first place!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/117/code102/p0/1"	"I like how she looks!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/117/code102/p0/2"	"You're right, Isa!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/121/code402/p1"	"I like how she looks!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/138/code402/p1"	"You're right, Isa!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@list/143/code401/p0"	"Everyone knows Karine is ugly!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/284/@name"	"TALK"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/2/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/3/code401/p0"	"Our poor school!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/4/code401/p0"	"It's a pool of blood now!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/12/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/13/code401/p0"	"Murphy, the dictator, sorry director, "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/14/code401/p0"	"has his office on the 3rd floor!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/30/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/31/code401/p0"	"That's what I've been trying to say"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/32/code401/p0"	"all along, we need a SHELTER, not a school, "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/33/code401/p0"	"a fast-food, not even an hospital!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/52/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/53/code401/p0"	"Yeah I know, and a national"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/54/code401/p0"	"treasure, so stand by me."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/59/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/60/code401/p0"	"You mean she is completely naked"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/61/code401/p0"	"and looks completely drunk?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/67/code101/p0"	"CINDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/68/code401/p0"	"I am... not drunk..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/69/code401/p0"	"Although yes it does seem that..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@list/70/code401/p0"	"I'm naked...."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/285/@name"	"TALK"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/286/@list/33/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/286/@list/34/code401/p0"	"No police. The police are DEAD!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/286/@list/35/code401/p0"	"Your only chance is with us!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/286/@list/72/code101/p0"	"LESLIE:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/286/@list/73/code401/p0"	"Shhh don't make so much noise!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/286/@list/74/code401/p0"	"We're staying. When the police arrive,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/286/@list/75/code401/p0"	"we'll be close to the entrance."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/286/@name"	"TALK"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/287/@name"	"TOKEN OSIRIS"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/288/@name"	"TOKEN SNAKE"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/290/@name"	"SCHOOL HEART"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/291/@name"	"SCHOOL BRAIN"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/13/code102/p0/0"	"I can see that, thank you"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/13/code102/p0/1"	"I'd love to make a painting of you"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/13/code102/p0/2"	"I'd love to make a painting of Sandy"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/13/code102/p0/3"	"\\n[23]"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/14/code402/p1"	"I can see that, thank you"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/21/code402/p1"	"I'd love to make a painting of you"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/46/code402/p1"	"I'd love to make a painting of Sandy"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/54/code402/p1"	"\\n[23]"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/67/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/68/code401/p0"	"I'd happily pose for you,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/69/code401/p0"	"granted that you're an actual painter,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@list/70/code401/p0"	"but there's hardly any time for this."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/292/@name"	"ART ROOM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/27/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/28/code401/p0"	"This was supposed to "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/29/code401/p0"	"be a stupid shelter!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/30/code401/p0"	"A stupid peaceful SHELTER!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/39/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/40/code401/p0"	"But they are everywhere!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/41/code401/p0"	"You always sound like a movie!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/48/code401/p0"	"I don't want my dead body to "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/49/code401/p0"	"appear all over the Net!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/53/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/54/code401/p0"	"Listen to \\n[1] instead of whining"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/55/code401/p0"	"like babies! He's right, we can still"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/56/code401/p0"	"overthrow them, fair and square!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/61/code101/p0"	"ALISON:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/62/code401/p0"	"Do they have water and food here?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/69/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/70/code401/p0"	"Right now we are the water and food "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/71/code401/p0"	"for them! We should try to evaluate how "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/72/code401/p0"	"big this bunker is."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/74/code401/p0"	"Maybe we could leave and I call my "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/75/code401/p0"	"dad, or Peterson?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/78/code401/p0"	"Oh no, I forgot about the"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/79/code401/p0"	"laser field!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/81/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/82/code401/p0"	"Wouldn't it be too dangerous anyway?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/104/code401/p0"	"Cindy, everything's still alright?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/117/code401/p0"	"Isa, is Karine okay?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/130/code101/p0"	"KARINE:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/131/code401/p0"	"I'm fine."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/133/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/134/code401/p0"	"I said nobody cares, bitch!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/136/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/137/code401/p0"	"No, let her talk a bit."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/139/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/140/code401/p0"	"What?!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/141/code401/p0"	"Oh, whatever..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/149/code101/p0"	"CINDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/150/code401/p0"	"See, it's not just me."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/151/code401/p0"	"I'm not a cry-baby, I can be tough even"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/152/code401/p0"	"though I'm a glamorous star."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@list/187/code401/p0"	"CAREFUL!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/293/@name"	"BNK"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/11/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/12/code401/p0"	"Yeah, I think so. Just like the one they"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/13/code401/p0"	"used to lock us in, those bastards!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/14/code401/p0"	"Don't get close to it."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/26/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/27/code401/p0"	"Yeah, you in particular, "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/28/code401/p0"	"with your nips sticking out,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/29/code401/p0"	"pay attention!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/33/code401/p0"	"We need to find a way to switch"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/34/code401/p0"	"the energy supply off."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/39/code101/p0"	"ALISON:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/40/code401/p0"	"But where is it?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/42/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/43/code401/p0"	"I don't know, that's why I said"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@list/44/code401/p0"	"we need to find it."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/294/@name"	"COMM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/295/@list/5/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/295/@list/6/code401/p0"	"Do they want to declare war on the"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/295/@list/7/code401/p0"	"world with so many of them?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/295/@list/9/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/295/@list/10/code401/p0"	"I'd like to know if this base is"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/295/@list/11/code401/p0"	"run by the government or"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/295/@list/12/code401/p0"	"a private corporation."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/295/@name"	"COMM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/296/@list/14/code401/p0"	"Let me give it a try!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/296/@list/40/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/296/@list/41/code401/p0"	"Why, you too, brain like boobs,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/296/@list/42/code401/p0"	"both very average but acceptable!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/296/@list/44/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/296/@list/45/code401/p0"	"Sometimes I don't know why I bother..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/296/@list/47/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/296/@list/48/code401/p0"	"Well don't! Our POTUS said it best!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/296/@list/49/code401/p0"	"The illegal aliens are taking our jobs!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/296/@list/68/code401/p0"	"Sandy, got an idea?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/296/@name"	"COMM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/297/@list/4/code101/p0"	"ORANGE:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/297/@list/5/code401/p0"	"Only at the beginning."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/297/@list/6/code401/p0"	"It was supposed to analyze me."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/297/@list/7/code401/p0"	"Then they let me out."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/297/@name"	"COMM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/298/@name"	"COMM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/1/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/2/code401/p0"	"This is getting darker and darker..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/5/code101/p0"	"CINDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/6/code401/p0"	"This place is more comfortable for me,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/7/code401/p0"	"because I don't risk people seeing me"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/8/code401/p0"	"without clothes on."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/10/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/11/code401/p0"	"Yes it's true."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/12/code401/p0"	"But I've gotten used to it "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/13/code401/p0"	"anyway, now."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/15/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/16/code401/p0"	"Don't be so stupid you too!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/17/code401/p0"	"There's nobody else but us here!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/18/code101/p0"	"And \\n[1], if he wanted to lust"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/19/code401/p0"	"over a good-looking woman,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/20/code401/p0"	"he wouldn't pick any of you for sure!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/22/code101/p0"	"CINDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/23/code401/p0"	"I look very good."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/25/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/26/code401/p0"	"If you like small and chubby with"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/27/code401/p0"	"mama boobs, then yes."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/29/code101/p0"	"CINDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/30/code401/p0"	"I'm a star so I look very good."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/32/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/33/code401/p0"	"Da fuck, you just got lucky"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/34/code401/p0"	"some producer needed an air-"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/35/code401/p0"	"head with big boobs!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/85/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/86/code401/p0"	"You're very big here too."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/87/code401/p0"	"*slaps her boob*"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/88/code401/p0"	"Remember you're my little fat cow."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/90/code101/p0"	"CINDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/91/code401/p0"	"I don't like you saying this,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@list/92/code401/p0"	"please stop."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/299/@name"	"COMM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@name"	"COMM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/1/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/2/code401/p0"	"Woah, those guys were in to"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/3/code401/p0"	"start World War III!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/5/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/6/code401/p0"	"Yeah, and to think we were hoping for"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/7/code401/p0"	"a peaceful world... you can always count"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/8/code401/p0"	"on govs to smash it all down."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/11/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/12/code401/p0"	"Orange, were you aware of this?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/13/code401/p0"	"Their army force?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/15/code101/p0"	"ORANGE:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/16/code401/p0"	"Yes, of course, but in my opinion, it's"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/17/code401/p0"	"only a small portion of what they are able"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/18/code401/p0"	"to... and not the most threatening one."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/20/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/300/@list/21/code401/p0"	"That says it all, really!"
