"CommonEvents.rxdata/303/@name"	"ACTIVITY BOOSTS"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/7/code401/p0"	"Also, your big butt could never"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/8/code401/p0"	"go through this small window."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/10/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/11/code401/p0"	"I don't have a big butt."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/12/code401/p0"	"Maybe big boobs, if you want."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/14/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/15/code401/p0"	"If you have big,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/16/code401/p0"	"then how are mine?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/18/code102/p0/0"	"More or less like Laura's"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/18/code102/p0/1"	"Huge"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/18/code102/p0/2"	"Gigantic"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/18/code102/p0/3"	"Rocket tits"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/19/code402/p1"	"More or less like Laura's"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/21/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/22/code401/p0"	"I'm baffled you can't see the difference."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/23/code401/p0"	"I can hardly fit mine in HER bikini."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/24/code401/p0"	"Anyway..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/28/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/29/code401/p0"	"(Thank you, that was sweet...)"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/33/code402/p1"	"Huge"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/35/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/36/code401/p0"	"Exactly! There's a big difference"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/37/code401/p0"	"with Laura's pretty common rack."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/41/code402/p1"	"Gigantic"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/43/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/44/code401/p0"	"Not sure if that's such a good way to"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/45/code401/p0"	"say it, but yes, that's the idea."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/47/code402/p1"	"Rocket tits"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/49/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@list/50/code401/p0"	"I wish you'd stop being so childish."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/305/@name"	"COMM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/12/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/13/code401/p0"	"Yeah, good job everyone!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/58/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/59/code401/p0"	"Here, your bikini."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/60/code401/p0"	"You lost it during your transformation."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/65/code401/p0"	"I've cleaned myself a bit too."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/66/code401/p0"	"I think I feel better now..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/68/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/69/code401/p0"	"... stupid idiotic woman!..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/70/code401/p0"	"Well, ""woman""..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/72/code101/p0"	"KARINE:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/73/code401/p0"	"I'm sorry. I feel like a monster, now."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/75/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/76/code401/p0"	"Yeah, that's what I've been telling"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@list/77/code401/p0"	"you ever since we met... "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/306/@name"	"BOSS DIAL"
