"CommonEvents.rxdata/308/@name"	"RESCUE"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/309/@list/86/code108/p0"	"If not > 44"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/309/@name"	"DRUGS"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/310/@name"	"AT YOUR SERVICE"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/311/@name"	"CINDY SKILL TOKEN"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/312/@name"	"FLASH"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/313/@name"	"BnB"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/314/@list/11/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/314/@list/12/code401/p0"	"I can't imagine what might have happened"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/314/@list/13/code401/p0"	"here!... all these poor people!..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/314/@name"	"COMM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/10/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/11/code401/p0"	"Are you asking because it's"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/12/code401/p0"	"the medical room?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/14/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/17/code401/p0"	"Yes of course!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/19/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/20/code401/p0"	"It's not the first time I do that."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/21/code401/p0"	"Okay, moment please."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/29/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/30/code401/p0"	"I want to be sure."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/31/code401/p0"	"And this time I'm not turning round."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/33/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/34/code401/p0"	"Okay then."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/35/code401/p0"	"But you must turn round."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/52/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/53/code401/p0"	"... I understand it's a bit stupid,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/54/code401/p0"	"but still, I'm not very sure."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/57/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/58/code401/p0"	"Look, Laura's been naked for so long, "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/59/code401/p0"	"and there's also Cindy, it's not like it's "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/60/code401/p0"	"that special anymore, you see?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/63/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/64/code401/p0"	"Look, Laura's been naked for"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/65/code401/p0"	"so long, it's not like it's that special"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/66/code401/p0"	"anymore, you see?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/93/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/94/code401/p0"	"(They are so much smaller than mine."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/95/code401/p0"	"And yet more prone to gravity... Not "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/96/code401/p0"	"everybody can be as exceptional as me!)"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/99/code101/p0"	"ALISON:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/100/code401/p0"	"(I hope he's not gonna ask me"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/101/code401/p0"	"to weigh myself...)"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/119/code401/p0"	"It makes me feel a bit ashamed..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/120/code401/p0"	"I could easily look much better."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/129/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/130/code401/p0"	"I know, not like we all haven't had plenty of "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/131/code401/p0"	"time to notice. But that's not important."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/132/code401/p0"	"You both look good the way you are."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/146/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/147/code401/p0"	"Of course, and you can show"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/148/code401/p0"	"some solidarity to Laura."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/151/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/152/code401/p0"	"True, but..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/157/code101/p0"	"It's already exceptional that I did it"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/158/code401/p0"	"in front of you and..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/159/code401/p0"	"You don't want to have another one "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/160/code401/p0"	"walking around like Laura and Cindy!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/170/code401/p0"	"It might become a bit too much!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/179/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/180/code401/p0"	"(He's so laxist with her!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/181/code401/p0"	"And never with me!!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@list/182/code401/p0"	"I'm like his girl toy!!)"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/315/@name"	"S WEIGHT"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/7/code401/p0"	"Laura is tied naked to the wooden pillar."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/34/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/35/code401/p0"	"Well, this is about art, isn't it?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/36/code401/p0"	"Not showing the most gorgeous"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/37/code401/p0"	"and arousing body?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/39/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/40/code401/p0"	"No, no, little Laura, not at all."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/42/code401/p0"	"You're more the type of the girl"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/43/code401/p0"	"next door, haha."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/45/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/46/code401/p0"	"Sorry if I'm not exactly a model..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/316/@list/47/code401/p0"	"Next time, just pick someone else."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/317/@list/16/code401/p0"	"Sandy is tied naked to the wooden pillar."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/317/@list/28/code401/p0"	"Sandy stands next to the wooden pillar."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/12/code401/p0"	"Cindy is tied naked to the wooden pillar."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/14/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/15/code401/p0"	"Okay everyone, ten minute lesson,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/16/code401/p0"	"take a sheet of paper and draw world-"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/17/code401/p0"	"wide star Cindy with no clothes at all!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/21/code101/p0"	"CINDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/22/code401/p0"	"I will try."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/24/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/25/code401/p0"	"Okay everyone, ten minute lesson,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/26/code401/p0"	"take a sheet of paper and draw world-"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/27/code401/p0"	"wide star Cindy, make her look good!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/51/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/52/code401/p0"	"It's a photograph of her I need, not a stupid"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/318/@list/53/code401/p0"	"picture! I could sell it for millions!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/319/@list/14/code401/p0"	"Nancy stands against the wooden pillar."
