"CommonEvents.rxdata/382/@name"	"COMM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/382/@list/2/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/382/@list/3/code401/p0"	"(Damn this is even bigger than Orange's"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/382/@list/4/code401/p0"	"monster tits, what a behemoth of a tank!)"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/382/@list/7/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/382/@list/8/code401/p0"	"(Damn this is even bigger than Nancy's"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/382/@list/9/code401/p0"	"tits, what a behemoth of a tank!)"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@name"	"COMM"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/1/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/2/code401/p0"	"And this has to be the Central"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/3/code401/p0"	"Intelligence Room!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/8/code401/p0"	"FINALLY!!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/18/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/19/code401/p0"	"What did you say?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/20/code401/p0"	"Lieutenant what?!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/22/code101/p0"	"ORANGE:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/23/code401/p0"	"There is someone here who was in"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/24/code401/p0"	"the bunker several times before,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/25/code401/p0"	"and... I'm not talking about myself."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/37/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/38/code401/p0"	"I thought you worked at the fucking"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/39/code401/p0"	"swimming-pool!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/44/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/45/code401/p0"	"I worked here as IT."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/47/code401/p0"	"The Army was leading top secret"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/48/code401/p0"	"research."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/50/code401/p0"	"Now it has all gone out of hand."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/51/code401/p0"	"But the moment I found out,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/53/code401/p0"	"I tried to save as many of you."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/54/code101/p0"	"The mission seemed possible."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/55/code401/p0"	"You all look good, so they were gonna"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/56/code401/p0"	"try to impregnate you rather than just..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/57/code401/p0"	"kill you."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/66/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/67/code401/p0"	"And when my dad's friend mentioned the"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/68/code401/p0"	"bunker, you knew about it already!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/70/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/71/code401/p0"	"So what?!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/73/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/74/code401/p0"	"You were undercover all this time,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/75/code401/p0"	"and we were naive enough "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/76/code401/p0"	"to believe you!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/78/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/79/code401/p0"	"Well it's done."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/80/code401/p0"	"What's the plan now? Are you the new guy "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/81/code401/p0"	"in charge or something?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/83/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/84/code401/p0"	"So it seems!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/85/code401/p0"	"And you better all behave, ha ha ha!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/87/code101/p0"	"ORANGE:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/88/code401/p0"	"Lieutenant Warwick, or should I call "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/89/code401/p0"	"you General now that all your superiors "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/90/code401/p0"	"are dead?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/92/code401/p0"	"I think there is something very "
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/93/code401/p0"	"unusual with the levels of energy."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/95/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/96/code401/p0"	"But you know things too,"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/97/code401/p0"	"are you a part of it as well or what?"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/99/code101/p0"	"ORANGE:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/100/code401/p0"	"I do know things. I've been here for"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/101/code401/p0"	"too long. General Warwick..."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/106/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/107/code401/p0"	"We won't know for sure until"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/383/@list/108/code401/p0"	"we check the main module, quick!"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/384/@name"	"MATCH NO"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/384/@list/1/code401/p0"	"Sadly, it didn't work, as the two of you"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/384/@list/2/code401/p0"	"didn't match."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/385/@list/1/code401/p0"	"Sadly, it didn't work, as love wasn't"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/385/@list/2/code401/p0"	"strong enough between you two."
"CommonEvents.rxdata/385/@name"	"LOVE NO"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/386/@name"	"OBD NO"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/386/@list/1/code401/p0"	"Sadly, it didn't work, as she didn't"
"CommonEvents.rxdata/386/@list/2/code401/p0"	"learn to obey you well enough."
