"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/441/code402/p1"	"Coca-Cola"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/457/code402/p1"	"Survival stuff"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/465/code402/p1"	"Go with Cindy"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/481/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/482/code401/p0"	"Just because she's the biggest star??"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/483/code401/p0"	"That's so unfair!"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/485/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/486/code401/p0"	"How do I get in?"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/545/code401/p0"	"Who will be driving my car?"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/567/code401/p0"	"Stop acting like a spoiled child!"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/577/code355/p0"	"Achievements.unlock(:FW1)"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/589/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/590/code401/p0"	"I'm not your mom."
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/591/code401/p0"	"You're all grown-up, "
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/592/code401/p0"	"a bit too much indeed."
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/594/code101/p0"	"CINDY:"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/595/code401/p0"	"What do you mean? This is no ordinary"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/596/code401/p0"	"situation, I need a strong man."
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/598/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/599/code401/p0"	"I could be your bodyguard."
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/600/code401/p0"	"If you pay me well."
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/602/code101/p0"	"CINDY:"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/603/code401/p0"	"It's not the proper time to talk"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@list/604/code401/p0"	"about this. You need to protect me!"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@pages/0/@graphic/@character_name"	"npc-cathy"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/15/@name"	"EV015"
