"Map001.rxdata/@events/25/@pages/0/@list/20/code401/p0"	"australian pop star. And you two?"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/25/@pages/0/@list/25/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"Map001.rxdata/@events/25/@pages/0/@list/26/code401/p0"	"That's okay."
"Map001.rxdata/@events/25/@pages/0/@list/28/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
