"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/148/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/149/code401/p0"	"Laura, Sandy, Cindy, you'll be"
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/150/code401/p0"	"hiding here for a while."
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/153/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/154/code401/p0"	"Laura, Sandy, you'll be hiding "
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/155/code401/p0"	"here for a while."
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/159/code101/p0"	"Here you won't be in danger."
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/160/code401/p0"	"Take off what you have, "
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/161/code401/p0"	"we might need it up there."
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/163/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/164/code401/p0"	"I don't have anything,"
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/165/code401/p0"	"as it's been for hours."
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/167/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/168/code401/p0"	"Not talking about your stupid clothes,"
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/169/code401/p0"	"give us anything that might be useful."
"Map020.rxdata/@events/10/@pages/0/@list/170/code401/p0"	"We're gonna have to fight up there!"
