"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/28/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/29/code401/p0"	"All? Karine is way too ugly to"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/30/code401/p0"	"ever pass the selection criteria."
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/40/code401/p0"	"Nancy, can you give me back the bikini?"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/42/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/43/code401/p0"	"Are you out of your mind? You want"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/44/code401/p0"	"ME to walk around naked in my own"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/45/code401/p0"	"school, where everyone knows me?"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/65/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/66/code401/p0"	"Laura keeps complaining but she"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/67/code401/p0"	"gets naked for a living."
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/68/code401/p0"	"I find that a bit ironic."
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/91/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/92/code401/p0"	"Nancy is right, you can't have something"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/93/code401/p0"	"back after you've given it away just"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/94/code401/p0"	"because you feel like it."
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/96/code401/p0"	"Don't push me to make you"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/97/code401/p0"	"apologize to all of us again."
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/99/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/100/code401/p0"	"This is so confusing and embarrassing."
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/102/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/103/code401/p0"	"I'm a bit fed up with this convo."
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/104/code401/p0"	"Can't we just move on and find survivors?"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/105/code101/p0"	"Because tell you what,"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/106/code401/p0"	"we won't fix that mess spending our "
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/107/code401/p0"	"time babbling about Laura's bikini!"
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/112/code401/p0"	"We've got a lot of junk to carry around. It'll "
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@pages/0/@list/113/code401/p0"	"be easier if some fight and some carry."
"Map021.rxdata/@events/22/@name"	"EV022"
