"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/147/code401/p0"	"Wait maybe Orange's just fucking high!"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/151/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/152/code401/p0"	"It's gonna be the end!"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/154/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/155/code401/p0"	"Or maybe she's just fucking high"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/156/code401/p0"	"and we shouldn't listen to her!"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/164/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/165/code401/p0"	"Did they drug you?"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/169/code101/p0"	"Oh, not from the beginning, "
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/170/code401/p0"	"but little by little. "
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/171/code401/p0"	"I've been their captive for "
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/172/code401/p0"	"several months."
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/173/code101/p0"	"I've been subjected to "
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/174/code401/p0"	"a lot of experiments,"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/175/code401/p0"	"abuse and torture."
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/176/code101/p0"	"The army people will not talk "
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/177/code401/p0"	"to anyone from outside. "
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/178/code401/p0"	"But through this experience,"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/179/code401/p0"	"I became one of theirs."
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/186/code101/p0"	"The bloody marks all over my body? "
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/187/code401/p0"	"They were testing my resistance"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/188/code401/p0"	"and trying to find out if I could cope"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/189/code401/p0"	"with Hell."
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/200/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/201/code401/p0"	"Have you found out how to repel"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/202/code401/p0"	"the monsters from Hell?"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/213/code401/p0"	"Maybe downstairs we'll find out more,"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/214/code401/p0"	"if we can reach that far."
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/219/code401/p0"	"Men and women alike are food."
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/220/code101/p0"	"But sometimes, "
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/221/code401/p0"	"it can happen that a young, healthy "
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/222/code401/p0"	"woman is chosen to become a host."
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/257/code401/p0"	"Once a body has ceased to live, they "
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/258/code401/p0"	"bring it back to life, only very different."
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/266/code101/p0"	"ORANGE:"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/267/code401/p0"	"Yes, gulp you, chew you, swallow you,"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/268/code401/p0"	"they'd especially like that you're fleshy,"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/269/code401/p0"	"although not as much as me."
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/271/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"Map030.rxdata/@events/8/@pages/1/@list/272/code401/p0"	"Oh my God, it's not just clothes I need,"
