"Map036.rxdata/@events/119/@name"	"EV119"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/12/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/13/code401/p0"	"But she's our friend."
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/15/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/16/code401/p0"	"She's not doing anything..."
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/17/code401/p0"	"Sandra, say something!"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/18/code401/p0"	"Otherwise he'll think you're one of them!"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/58/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/59/code401/p0"	"Your Sandra's got nothing under her "
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/60/code401/p0"	"apron, I just noticed... that doesn't seem"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/61/code401/p0"	"very natural to be honest."
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/69/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/70/code401/p0"	"Why not, it's not very difficult!"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/71/code401/p0"	"Sandra, we're going, "
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@list/72/code401/p0"	"we'll be back shortly!"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/0/@graphic/@character_name"	"npc-sandra"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/1/@graphic/@character_name"	"npc-sandra"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/2/@list/17/code401/p0"	"Murphy, he got contaminated!"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/2/@list/33/code401/p0"	"But I'm fine, I need to come with you."
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/2/@list/35/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/2/@list/36/code401/p0"	"Sure, why not?"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/27/@pages/2/@list/37/code401/p0"	"(She's hot and she's got big boobs, like "
