"Map036.rxdata/@events/120/@pages/0/@list/26/code402/p1"	"Nancy"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/120/@pages/0/@list/28/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"Map036.rxdata/@events/120/@pages/0/@list/29/code401/p0"	"I'd be happy to go with you,"
