"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/15/code101/p0"	"MURPHY:"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/16/code401/p0"	"You were always among the most "
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/17/code401/p0"	"gorgeous in the class, I never cease"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/18/code401/p0"	"to wonder how you didn't make it..."
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/20/code401/p0"	"But still, that's a little bit tacky."
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/54/code401/p0"	"I'm the BOSS of these girls!"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/56/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/57/code401/p0"	"No, you need a quick update,"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/58/code401/p0"	"it's me now!"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/135/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/136/code401/p0"	"Ah yes, I'd forgotten "
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/137/code401/p0"	"it's a rich girls' haven."
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/173/code401/p0"	"(long speech)"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/178/code401/p0"	"(really long speech)"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/216/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/217/code401/p0"	"A what, really?"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/218/code401/p0"	"BUNKER?!"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/275/code101/p0"	"ISA:"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/276/code401/p0"	"Am I the only one who thinks it's"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/277/code401/p0"	"a bit crazy there's a bunker just out"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/278/code401/p0"	"of town?"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/284/code101/p0"	"SANDY:"
"Map039.rxdata/@events/4/@pages/0/@list/285/code401/p0"	"It's secret, it's a bunker,"
