"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/2/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 9"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/8/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 1"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/11/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 9"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/12/code101/p0"	"ORANGE:"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/13/code401/p0"	"Yes, exactly!"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/14/code401/p0"	"And it won't let us do what"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/15/code401/p0"	"we want!"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/16/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 3"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/17/code101/p0"	"NANCY:"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/18/code401/p0"	"So it's the moment we run for our lives??"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/19/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 9"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/23/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 1"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@pages/0/@list/28/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 0"
"Troops.rxdata/67/@name"	"Aghadominiom"
"Troops.rxdata/69/@name"	"Blackhawk Pyromaniac*2, Cyborg Tanker"
"Troops.rxdata/70/@name"	"Blackhawk Eradicator, Blackhawk Soldier,"
"Troops.rxdata/71/@name"	"Cyborg Tanker*2"
"Troops.rxdata/73/@name"	"Underworld Plague"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/0/@list/4/code401/p0"	"Don't try you can go against my will!"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/0/@list/5/code401/p0"	"As I've arrived, to collect my little pets!"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/0/@list/7/code401/p0"	"You think you can stop me?"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/0/@list/8/code401/p0"	"This mistake will be your downfall!"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/0/@list/12/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 6"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/0/@list/13/code101/p0"	"ALISON:"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/0/@list/14/code401/p0"	"I'm not a pet... or, if I am,"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/0/@list/15/code401/p0"	"then I belong to \\n[1]..."
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/0/@list/16/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 0"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/0/@list/19/code401/p0"	"Hahaha, poor lost soul,"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/0/@list/20/code401/p0"	"you're next, after the other two!"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/2/@list/5/code401/p0"	"Laura! You are bestowed with the honor"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/2/@list/6/code401/p0"	"to join my ranks! Come immediately!"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/3/@list/5/code401/p0"	"Sandy! You are bestowed with the honor"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/3/@list/6/code401/p0"	"to join my ranks! Come immediately!"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/3/@list/18/code401/p0"	"You both are mine, now!"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@pages/3/@list/19/code401/p0"	"And nothing's gonna change that!"
"Troops.rxdata/74/@name"	"Sandy, Laura, Zoo Station"
