"Troops.rxdata/88/@pages/0/@list/3/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 1"
"Troops.rxdata/88/@pages/0/@list/4/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Troops.rxdata/88/@pages/0/@list/5/code401/p0"	"Wow that escalated quite quickly!"
"Troops.rxdata/88/@pages/0/@list/6/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 2"
"Troops.rxdata/88/@pages/0/@list/7/code101/p0"	"LAURA:"
"Troops.rxdata/88/@pages/0/@list/8/code401/p0"	"She wanted to join us minutes ago,"
"Troops.rxdata/88/@pages/0/@list/9/code401/p0"	"now she's a monster!!"
