"Troops.rxdata/89/@pages/0/@list/4/code101/p0"	"\\n[1]:"
"Troops.rxdata/89/@pages/0/@list/5/code401/p0"	"The hot bitch got contaminated too!"
"Troops.rxdata/89/@pages/0/@list/6/code401/p0"	"Time for all the other girls to get revenge,"
"Troops.rxdata/89/@pages/0/@list/7/code401/p0"	"I guess!"
"Troops.rxdata/89/@pages/0/@list/8/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 0"
"Troops.rxdata/89/@pages/0/@list/11/code401/p0"	"Cindy, stupid little slut, showing yourself"
"Troops.rxdata/89/@pages/0/@list/12/code401/p0"	"off like that, I'll take care of you!"
"Troops.rxdata/89/@pages/0/@list/16/code355/p0"	"$game_temp.message_actor_id = 4"
"Troops.rxdata/89/@pages/0/@list/17/code101/p0"	"CINDY:"
"Troops.rxdata/89/@pages/0/@list/18/code401/p0"	"Help me please,"
